<title>USA: Synthetic Industries Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Synthetic Industries Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICKAMAUGA, Ga. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			Fourth Quarter Ended    Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			 9/30/96	9/30/95    9/30/96    9/30/95</p>
<p> Net sales	   $87,472	$77,078   $299,532   $271,427</p>
<p> Net income	    5,316	  (619)	8,102	1,936</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>			    0.90	 (0.10)	 1.37	 0.33</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,930,502    5,930,502  5,930,502  5,930,502</p>
<p>1995 Q4 includes a pretax charge of $2.9 million.</p>
<p>Company held initial public offering on November 1, 1996, raising proceeds of $34 million.  </p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
